                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This legislation marks the jumping-off point for the widespread adoption of blockchain technology throughout our country. Whether it\u2019s in finance, logistics, healthcare, or commerce \u2013 distributed ledger technology can revolutionize our economy with faster, more secure, and trustworthy transactions of assets and data. I commend Chairman McHenry and Chairman Thompson on their efforts to pass this legislation. I also thank my colleagues who acknowledged the gravity of this legislation and supported our efforts to bring regulatory clarity to this growing industry. America must mimic our embrace of the internet and become a leader in the development and utilization of this generation's next revolutionary tool.",
                "text_lang": "en",
