                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "By restricting these purchases, we are not just saving on healthcare costs but also investing in the long-term health of our communities. Kudos to @SecRollins for pushing forward with this initiative. Let's make sure our SNAP dollars are spent on nutritious food that fuels growth and wellness, not just quick fixes.",
