                "retweet_count": 26,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If we had enhanced ID and income eligibility requirements for Medicaid recipients, we could save $200 billion annually. If you expand those enhanced requirements to all social safety nets, that\u2019s one TRILLION dollars a year in savings.\n\nWith modern and simple solutions, we are going to ensure that deserving recipients get their benefits promptly AND deliver massive savings back to the American people.",
